From: Tong <zhengtong0611@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:10:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] Verdict dances: Victory and Defeat idles from FBX
 (VerdictDanceCli)

VerdictDanceCli.Build turns humanoid animation FBX files (Mixamo's Victory
and Defeated idles) into <name>.unity3d dance bundles: imported as
Humanoid, the clip made a looping in-place clip saved as a standalone .anim
(no mesh in the bundle), plus a silent track so a short idle loops smoothly
for the whole verdict dance instead of restarting. The launcher and the
mock now default to Victory / Defeat for the winner / loser (the draw keeps
the community dance).
